      "MdAE": 1.0932,
      "RMSE": 3.2217,
      "Standardized_Accuracy": 0.4581,
      "Snapped_MAE": 1.7391
    },
    "plain_statement": "Plain takeaway on project identity:\n1. Type Only achieves test MAE = 1.9715.\n2. Adding Project-ID one-hot to Type reduces test MAE to 1.7693 (10.26% relative improvement).\n3. TF-IDF + Type achieves test MAE = 1.7607 (10.69% relative improvement).\nComparing Type+Project-ID (1.7693) with TF-IDF+Type (1.7607) shows that explicit project identity captures 95.9% of the gain achieved by TF-IDF text. Thus, a large portion of the text signal acts as an implicit proxy for project identity, though text provides additional intra-project fine-tuning."
  },
